<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52892" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κά̆λυπτ-ρα</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰλύπτ-ρη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>veil</i> or
				<i>head-dress</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ δὲ λιπαρὴν ἔρριψε καλύπτρην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.406
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.232
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Parm.
				1.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				537
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				122
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. πλοκάμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					18
				</span></i>
			; esp. <i>bride's veil</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				107.4
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δνοφερὰ κ</span>. the
			dark <i>veil</i> of night, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				811
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> land
			given to queens as <i>veil-money</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζώνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.3
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				1.123c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				19(41).4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cover, lid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρετρέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.64
				</span></i>
			(pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμιατηρίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1396.31
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>seed-capsule,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				11.11.2
			</span></i>.</div>
